{'symbol': 'PHM', 'date': '2022-05-09 08:15:00', 'title': 'THE PULTE FAMILY COMMENDS OUTGOING PULTEGROUP (NYSE:PHM) DIRECTOR RICHARD DREILING', 'text': "BOCA RATON, FLA., MAY 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE PULTE FAMILY WOULD LIKE TO COMMEND RICHARD DREILING, LEAD INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR OF LOWE'S HOME IMPROVEMENT (NYSE:LOW) AND EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN OF DOLLAR TREE (NYSE:DLTR), FOR HIS SERVICE ON THE INDEPENDENT BOARD OF DIRECTORS FOR PULTEGROUP, INC. (NYSE:PHM) WHERE HE SERVED AS CHAIR OF NOMINATING AND GOVERNANCE FOR A PERIOD OF TIME."}